1
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,480
Shake your hips, girls!

2
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:13,600
Go!

3
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:17,760
Remember this.

4
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,120
In our industry,

5
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,720
service comes first.

6
00:01:22,039 --> 00:01:23,280
So delicious.

7
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:27,580
I'll come again tomorrow.

8
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:30,380
What a handsome young gentleman.

9
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:31,520
Are you here alone?

10
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,520
Madam,

11
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:33,800
I'm looking for someone.

12
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:34,600
Madam?

13
00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:36,240
Big sister,

14
00:01:36,479 --> 00:01:37,280
Big sister?

15
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,320
Miss,

16
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:39,800
How should I

17
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,600
address you?

18
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:43,280
Just call me Sister.

19
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:46,280
My name is Yingxiang,

20
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,680
and my surname is Liu.

21
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,920
What a good name.

22
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:53,800
Smiling and chatting, leaving a faint fragrance behind.

23
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,120
I came here

24
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:57,000
for good food.

25
00:01:58,520 --> 00:02:00,600
Don't be shy.

26
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:03,080
Everyone who comes here is looking for someone.

27
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:04,160
Tell me,

28
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:06,080
what kind of person are you looking for?

29
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:08,360
I don't need company today.

30
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,880
I heard from a friend

31
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:12,360
that the West Lake vinegar fish at Baixiang Restaurant is good.

32
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,920
I came here specifically

33
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:16,720
to taste it quietly.

34
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:17,880
I wonder

35
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:20,880
if you could personally taste it with me?

36
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,520
You want me to taste it with you?

37
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:27,600
Naturally, I need the most beautiful person by my side.

38
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:29,880
You little thing.

39
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,480
You're quite cute.

40
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:34,060
Yingxiang is here to welcome you.

41
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,960
Sister.

42
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,680
I think this room is pretty good.

43
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,200
Stop messing around.

44
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:48,520
This is the accounting room of our Baixiang Pavilion.

45
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,680
You can't eat here.

46
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,240
Sister,

47
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:51,880
this accounting room of yours

48
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:54,120
has excellent Feng Shui.

49
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,680
Wealth will surely roll in.

50
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,680
You know quite a bit about Feng Shui.

51
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,680
Just a little.

52
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:00,560
It's necessary for traveling the world.

53
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,560
I didn't expect you to be so amazing.

54
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,280
How about tonight,

55
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,720
you take me to your room

56
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,450
and have a good chat with me?

57
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:08,680
Sure.

58
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,880
Looking at your outfit, sir,

59
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,650
you must have returned from studying abroad.

60
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,140
Do you know about Western clocks?

61
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,180
I've seen them.

62
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:30,120
I have one of those at home.

63
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,520
It always rings at night,

64
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:34,280
giving me a headache

65
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,680
and making me anxious.

66
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,680
Since you're here today,

67
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,920
you must be a helper sent by heaven.

68
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:42,760
Why don't you

69
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,200
come to

70
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,480
my house today?

71
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,660
Take a good look for me.

72
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:08,280
It's all Boss Qian.

73
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:11,960
Could it be Boss Qian from Qian's Clothing Store?

74
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:15,730
How could he have any connection with Liu Yingxiang?

75
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,600
Twenty goats.

76
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:20,880
What do these goats and numbers represent?

77
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,380
To be honest with you, sister.

78
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:26,560
I came here today

79
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,040
to discuss a deal.

80
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:30,000
What deal?

81
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:30,960
Let's hear it.

82
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:33,080
My younger sister went missing

83
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:35,000
around here a few days ago.

84
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:37,360
I heard human traffickers are rampant lately.

85
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,320
I don't know where she was taken.

86
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:42,080
I'm really at my wit's end,

87
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:43,880
so I can only wander around here.

88
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,400
Sister,

89
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,080
please help me.

90
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:48,960
This...

91
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,280
Is that true?

92
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,080
Sister.

93
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,880
My parents died when I was young.

94
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,120
My sister and I

95
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:59,080
have depended on each other since childhood.

96
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,800
Since my sister went missing,

97
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,320
I've been in tears

98
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,880
all day, every day.

99
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:07,540
Don't you believe me, sister?

100
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,320
I don't know about this,

101
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,400
but I've heard some rumors.

102
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,160
Sister.

103
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:15,160
If you can help me find my sister,

104
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,080
let alone this money,

105
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:18,800
even if it bankrupts me

106
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,120
to repay you.

107
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:22,320
You will be my great benefactor.

108
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:26,610
I've been in the game of love for so many years.

109
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:28,760
I've long stopped caring

110
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,440
about gold and silver.

111
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,800
Sister.

112
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,120
Whatever you want,

113
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,159
as long as I have it

114
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:36,400
and can offer it,

115
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:37,920
I will present it with both hands

116
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,360
to Sister Yingxiang.

117
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:43,520
If you can

118
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:44,920
sleep with me tonight,

119
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:48,120
what's the harm in telling you some leads?

120
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:52,920
It's the best of both worlds.

121
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,240
Bad news, boss.

122
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:58,220
Someone seems to have entered the accounting room.

123
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:58,880
Sir.

124
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,800
I'll be right back.

125
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,560
Wait for me.

126
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,680
Of course.

127
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:16,880
Don't run!

128
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,260
Come, this way.

129
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,680
What did you find?

130
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,480
Qian's Clothing Store.

131
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,360
Catch him! Stop them!

132
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,080
Bad news, boss.

133
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:29,720
Those two have already escaped.

134
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,600
Escaped?

135
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:31,360
Yes.

136
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:33,720
Send someone to notify our benefactor.

137
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:36,320
And notify Boss Qian as well.

138
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:37,560
Yes.

139
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:39,810
No entry.

140
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,920
I'm looking for Inspector Zhou.

141
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,120
Why are you here again?

142
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,680
Reporting another case?

143
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,810
I was just passing by

144
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,570
and came to see a friend.

145
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:55,720
Is that not allowed?

146
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,520
Miss.

147
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:58,520
We've only met twice.

148
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,480
Are we friends now?

149
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,280
Looking at

150
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:03,680
your face,

151
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:06,240
you seem to have a conscience.

152
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,480
But

153
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:09,080
how can you

154
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:10,800
neglect your duties?

155
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:11,640
Hey.

156
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,240
Watch your mouth.

157
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:15,080
How am I neglecting my duties

158
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:15,880
and lacking a conscience?

159
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:16,480
Fine.

160
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,740
Then let me ask you.

161
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:19,280
Recently, many young girls have gone missing

162
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:20,360
in the concession.

163
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,210
Why don't you

164
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:22,330
go look for them?

165
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:24,080
This case

166
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,880
is still under secret investigation.

167
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:28,410
It's a classified file of our police station.

168
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:30,160
How did you know?

169
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,820
That's none of your business.

170
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:34,680
But if you rescue them,

171
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,280
I will allow you

172
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:37,760
to become a friend

173
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,680
of me, Huo Yining.

174
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,370
Become your Huo.

175
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,360
Interesting.

176
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,340
Hold my arm.

177
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,320
What are you doing?

178
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,850
We have to put on a full show.

179
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,120
You two.

180
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:09,560
Are you here to make clothes?

181
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,680
Make two qipaos for my wife.

182
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,160
It's an honor for our shop.

183
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:16,160
Please come with me to take your measurements, madam.

184
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:17,640
Sir,

185
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,920
please wait a moment.

186
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,280
Go ahead.

187
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:44,520
Boss.

188
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:46,360
Could you pour me a cup of tea?

189
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,680
No problem.

190
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:16,480
My daughter's name is Lingling.

191
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:20,560
She has been selling cigarettes at the entrance of Baixianglou Ballroom.

192
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:22,600
This Boss Qian really has a problem.

193
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:05,640
Siyao.

194
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:06,840
Siyao.

195
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,170
You're injured.

196
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:09,940
It's nothing, just a scratch.

197
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:17,080
How can you do it yourself?

198
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:18,720
I can.

199
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,340
You don't trust me?

200
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:21,340
Let me do it.

201
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,080
Senior Sister,

202
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,410
you're injured.

203
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:26,880
It's nothing, just a scratch.

204
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,080
What did you find out?

205
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,280
You were right.

206
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,320
Recently, in several main streets of the city,

207
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:33,050
young girls have gone missing.

208
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:35,400
They are mostly young female students,

209
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:37,480
or women who dress

210
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,800
very fashionably.

211
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,640
And the time of disappearance is always

212
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:42,300
at midnight or in the morning.

213
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:45,760
Disappearances have also occurred frequently in the concession.

214
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:46,690
The concession?

215
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,280
How do you know?

216
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,680
I happened to pass by,

217
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:52,280
and thought I'd trick that kid Zhou Wei.

218
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,720
As expected,

219
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:55,680
they are also investigating in secret.

220
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:56,960
Zhou Wei.

221
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:00,480
That means it's not a solo crime.

222
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:01,920
I heard you got injured.

223
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:06,400
Officer Ye's first day on the job.

224
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:08,520
You're doing the work of serving others.

225
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,280
Siyao,

226
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:11,290
I don't mean to lecture you.

227
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:13,080
You are currently suspended

228
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,360
and cannot investigate cases.

229
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:16,200
Why are you taking new officers to investigate cases?

230
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,880
You have no respect for the police station.

231
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:19,080
As a citizen,

232
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,160
I was injured

233
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:22,400
and brought to the police station by two officers

234
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:23,530
to bandage my wounds

235
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,680
and learn about the case.

236
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:25,080
Is there a problem?

237
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:25,880
What case?

238
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:28,560
We found out that Qian Yanqing, the owner of the clothing store,

239
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:30,600
is involved in the recent human trafficking

240
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,080
and missing girls cases,

241
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:34,460
and we have obtained relevant clues.

242
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:36,800
What are you waiting for?

243
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:38,260
Come with me to arrest him.

244
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,080
Alright, alright.

245
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:41,480
Apply more medicine since you're injured.

246
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:43,680
Senior Sister,

247
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,360
why did you tell him?

248
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,480
Aren't you afraid he'll ruin things?

249
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,280
This is called

250
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,880
playing hard to get.
